## 🔒 Security Guidelines

### Always Check For:
- Input validation and sanitization
- SQL injection vulnerabilities
- XSS (Cross-Site Scripting) risks
- CSRF token usage
- Authentication and authorization
- Sensitive data exposure (API keys, passwords)
- Dependency vulnerabilities

